  "details": "A status that lets others see where a friend is, but have to invite-request rather than directly join them would be great.\n\nI don't necessarily feel comfortable having my friends pop into worlds unannounced, and I know others don't either, but I'd be happy to get an invite request. It can be nice to ask others if someone they don't know is welcome and pre-introduce them before they show up. Other times, some people and some groups may be great on their own but not go well together, and a bit of screening makes all the difference.",
